  "solution": {
    "text": "From conservation of mechanical energy<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math>",
